===persian===

افق ها سایه روشن گرم خونند نمی دونی که مرغان خیالت به طاق سینه ام با درد چونند

۱۳۳۹

===machine===

The horizons are bright, warm shadows. Don't you know that the birds of your imagination are pecking in pain at the vault of my chest

1339

===lantern===

The horizons are a warm half-light of blood —
don't you know how the birds of your memory
beat in pain against the vault of my chest?

1339

